# This file contains the Bulgarian localization of the
# Raku Programming Language.
#
# CONTRIBUTORS:
#
# Andrew Shitov (Russian version)
# Anton Antonov (Bulgarian version, translated from the Russian version)
#
# This file is the source the two modules are generated FROM.  After
# changing anything below, regenerate them from the distribution root with
# the script the L10N distribution installs:
#
#     update-localization
#
# It needs Rakudo: Raku++ runs the modules generated here but cannot load
# L10N itself, stopping at `use L10N` with "the module registered no slang".
# The script builds both modules from the lines below and then precompiles
# the slang to check that what it wrote works.

